  "explanation": "<h3>Initial machine basis</h3><p>$120,000 + $8,000 installation = $128,000.</p><h3>Machine adjusted basis after improvement and depreciation</h3><p>$128,000 + $12,000 − $45,000 = $95,000.</p><h3>Inherited land basis</h3><p>Use the stated date-of-death value.</p><h3>Converted equipment depreciation basis</h3><p>Use the lower of adjusted basis and conversion-date fair value.</p>"
